\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Gate operating curves on 2319 Paderborn recordings: correct fault verdicts against false acceptance on the 480 healthy recordings, as each gate's parameter is swept. Filled circles mark the operating points fixed before evaluation. The envelope threshold rule lies on or above the others everywhere. The vertical range starts at 292 verdicts: the raw-spectrum band rule returns no correct verdict below \SI {10.8}{\percent } false acceptance, and its own operating point lies at \SI {45}{\percent }, off the right of the axis.}}{12}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:roc}{{5}{12}{Gate operating curves on 2319 Paderborn recordings: correct fault verdicts against false acceptance on the 480 healthy recordings, as each gate's parameter is swept. Filled circles mark the operating points fixed before evaluation. The envelope threshold rule lies on or above the others everywhere. The vertical range starts at 292 verdicts: the raw-spectrum band rule returns no correct verdict below \SI {10.8}{\percent } false acceptance, and its own operating point lies at \SI {45}{\percent }, off the right of the axis}{figure.5}{}}
